%F A293955 a(n) ~ exp(n^2/2 + n - 1/12) * A^2 / (n^(n/2 + 1/3) * 2^((n-1)/2) * Pi^((n+1)/2)), where A is the Glaisher-Kinkelin constant A074962. - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Oct 23 2026
